  "SNORD50B": "SNORD50B is a C/D box-type small nucleolar RNA (snoRNA) that is predicted to function as a guide RNA in 2-prime O-methylation of 28S ribosomal RNA (Tanaka et al., 2000 [PubMed 10792466]).[supplied by OMIM, Feb 2010].",
