  "CYP2G1P": "Predicted to enable heme binding activity and monooxygenase activity. Predicted to be involved in epoxygenase P450 pathway and xenobiotic catabolic process. Predicted to be active in cytoplasm and intracellular membrane-bounded organelle. [provided by Alliance of Genome Resources, Apr 2022]",
