  "TBC1D3P1-DHX40P1": "This locus represents naturally-occurring readthrough transcription that extends through two unprocessed pseudogenes, TBC1D3P1 (TBC1 domain family member 3 pseudogene 1) and DHX40P1 (DEAH-box helicase 40 pseudogene 1), to protein-coding RNFT1 (ring finger protein, transmembrane 1). The individual pseudogene loci are not curated as transcribed regions. The readthrough transcript likely does not encode a functional protein, since translation of the long open reading frames would render the transcript a candidate for nonsense-mediated decay (NMD). [provided by RefSeq, Jan 2016].",
