  "LMBR1L": "Enables transmembrane signaling receptor activity. Involved in receptor-mediated endocytosis and signal transduction. Located in endoplasmic reticulum membrane and plasma membrane. Is integral component of plasma membrane. [provided by Alliance of Genome Resources, Apr 2022]",
