  "ZCWPW1": "Enables methyl-CpG binding activity and methylated histone binding activity. Predicted to be involved in meiosis I; positive regulation of DNA metabolic process; and spermatogenesis. Predicted to act upstream of or within homologous chromosome pairing at meiosis. Predicted to be located in XY body. Predicted to be active in nucleus. [provided by Alliance of Genome Resources, Apr 2022]",
